res-p type-footnote"><span class="type-footnote is-emph">³<!-- --> <!-- -->Crypto &amp; prediction markets.</span> <!-- -->Cryptocurrency and prediction market services are offered through regulated third-party partners, not by Alpaca. Cryptocurrencies are not securities and are not protected by FDIC or SIPC.</p><p class="berry-disclosures-p type-footnote"><span class="type-footnote is-emph">⁴<!-- --> <!-- -->Investors.</span> <!-- -->The names and logos of Morgan Creek, Coinbase, SGV, Ripio, and other investors are used for identification and informational purposes only; Coinbase’s investment was made by Coinbase Ventures through its Base Ecosystem Fund. Their inclusion does not constitute an endorsement, recommendation, or sponsorship of Berry, its products, or any content Berry publishes, and these parties bear no responsibility for Berry’s services or communications.</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script>(function(){try{window.__berryRestoreScroll&&window.__berryRestoreScroll();}catch(e){}})();</script><script>
